<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your Order Has Been Delivered!</title>
    <style type="text/css">
        body{
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            height: 100vh;
            min-width: 100%;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: black;
        }

        a{
            text-decoration: 24px;
        }

        h1{
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.25;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        p{
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;   
        }

        .email-wrapper{
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
            background-color: aliceblue;
            padding: 20px;

        }

        .email-header{
            background-color: black;
            padding: 30px;
            color: violet;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .email-body{
            padding: 14px;
            background-color: white;
            height: 70%;

        }

        .email-footer{
            background-color: black;
            padding: 14px;
            color: violet;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .product-list{
            margin: flex;
        }
        
        .product-item{
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;    
            margin-bottom: 20px;

        }

        .product-img{
            max-width: 100px;
            margin-right: 20px;
        }

        .product-details{
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        img{
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-header">
            <img src="" height="200px" width="200px" alt="LuminSkin Logo"/>
        </div>
    </div class="email-body">
        <h1>Your Order Has Been Delivered!</h1>
        <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
        <p>
            We are excited to inform you that your order has been delivered! Thank you for choosing us. We hope you enjoy your purchase. If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to us.
        </p>
        <p><strong>PickUp Station</strong>Gaudamukh-13,Pokhara,Nepal</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <h2>Order Details</h2>
        <div class="product-list">
            <% products.forEach(function(product) { %>
            <div class="product-item">
              <img
                class="product-img"
                src="<%= product.img %>"
                alt="<%= product.title %>"
              />
              <div class="product-details">
                <p><strong>Product:</strong> <%= product.title %></p>
                <p><strong>Quantity:</strong> <%= product.quantity %></p>
                <p><strong>Price:</strong> $<%= product.price %></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <% }); %>
          </div>
          <p>If you have any questions or need further assistance, feel free to <a href="">contact us</a>.</p>
          <p>Thank you for shopping with us!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="email-footer">
          <p>&copy;2024 Beauty Bliss. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
</body>
</html>